    "body": "You can do that with a custom configuration of the `[directory]` module. My config looks like:\r\n```toml\r\n[directory.substitutions]\r\n\"~/Documents\" = \" \"\r\n\"~/Music\" = \"ﱘ \"\r\n\"~/Movies\" = \" \"\r\n\"~/Pictures\" = \" \"\r\n\"~/Sources\" = \"謹\"\r\n\"/\" = \"  \"\r\n```\r\n\r\n<img width=\"184\" alt=\"Starship-Directory module\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/2911922/226290983-b51748b5-5943-475b-b7ff-51a0ef31b76a.png\">\r\nLooks like this with a NerdFont.\r\n\r\nFor further information, look at [Starship documentation: Configuration/Directory](https://starship.rs/config/#directory).",
